       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. RELFILE.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT REL-FILE ASSIGN TO REL-FILE
               ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
               ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
               RELATIVE KEY IS WS-REL-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD REL-FILE.
       01 REL-RECORD PIC X(80).

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-REL-KEY PIC 9(4).
       01 WS-STATUS PIC XX.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           OPEN INPUT REL-FILE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-REL-KEY.
           READ REL-FILE NEXT RECORD
               INVALID KEY DISPLAY 'STATUS ' WS-STATUS
               NOT INVALID KEY DISPLAY REL-RECORD
           END-READ.
           CLOSE REL-FILE.
           STOP RUN.
